{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-tourn-111"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816290-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신이 또다시 타임 에이전시 은행의 로비에 들어서자, 직원들의 피부가 검은색과 빨간색으로 바뀌며 환영의 뜻을 표했다. 당신은 자동인출기로 가서 이전에 맡겨둔 시간을 인출하고자 한다","talkId":403816290,"textHash":"15890952047548751233","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/talk-403816290","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"407639643cc7635c","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816291-line"],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816291-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「귀하의 정기 예금 인출 신청이 감지되었습니다. 귀하의 재산을 안전하게 보호하기 위해, 2차 보안 질문에 답하여 개인 신분을 인증해주세요」","talkId":403816291,"textHash":"16769778970046226496","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/talk-403816291","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"407639643cc7635c","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-18016369363893169877-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"토마토의 끝부분","talkId":null,"textHash":"18016369363893169877","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/text-18016369363893169877","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"1bc6db7794dbc205","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-1475814299079052968-effect"],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-1475814299079052968-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"나의 출생지는 토마토의 끝부분이다","talkId":null,"textHash":"1475814299079052968","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/text-1475814299079052968","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"1bc6db7794dbc205","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)","bwikiReplyToIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-18016369363893169877-choice"]},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-17356878228807786695-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"제Ⅸ 기관 유닛 부지","talkId":null,"textHash":"17356878228807786695","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/text-17356878228807786695","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"f53e4a7c2675de6b","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-2774113032651042041-effect"],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-2774113032651042041-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"나의 출생지는 제Ⅸ 기관 유닛 부지다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2774113032651042041","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/text-2774113032651042041","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"f53e4a7c2675de6b","b