iverse-event-tourn-111-text-15677613854981280794-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"원금을 인출한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"15677613854981280794","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/text-15677613854981280794","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e0d5a4295f967bc7","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-18255628781216804382-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"이자를 인출한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"18255628781216804382","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/text-18255628781216804382","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"80e730f9eadeed0c","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-8557400526114806274-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"지식을 인출한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"8557400526114806274","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/text-8557400526114806274","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d8484ca33945f118","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-1374741852946422357-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"기억을 인출한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"1374741852946422357","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/text-1374741852946422357","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"19a4e3335eaff302","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816302-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"직원들의 피부가 노란색과 파란색으로 바뀌며 배웅의 뜻을 표했다. 「타임 에이전시 은행을 이용해 주셔서 감사합니다——꼭 명심하세요. 시간은 곧 돈이고 곧은 곧 전부입니다」","talkId":403816302,"textHash":"16716653851172943334","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/talk-403816302","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5130871b76a31870","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816294-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"보안 질문의 답이 틀려 인증에 실패했습니다. 처음으로 계좌를 개설하는 예금주일 경우, 직원 창구로 이동하세요. 직원이 계좌 개설을 도와드릴 겁니다","talkId":403816294,"textHash":"10151238305252032680","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/talk-403816294","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"fab89b542e41f423","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816295-line"],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816295-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"또한, 타임 에이전시 은행에서 알려드립니다. 개인 시간을 잘 보관하세요","talkId":403816295,"textHash":"11322259406509759462","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/talk-403816295","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"fab89b542e41f423","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-4762774851466939014-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"보안 인증 실패, 일단 떠난다","talkId":null,"textHash":"4762774851466939014","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/text-4762774851466939014","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e36ba41dc8b528b5","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816304-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-111","missionId":"event-tourn-111","mission":"시간 은행 (2)","scene":"시간 은행 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"비밀번호와 씨름하기보다 더 효율적인 전략을 택했다——항상 명심하자. 시간은 곧 돈이다","talkId":403816304,"textHash":"5119540329336959395","source":"tournHandBookEvent:111/talk-403816304","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"729686638cbc7e1b","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其二）","bwikiRevision":95730,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13820","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (2)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816290-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-talk-403816291-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-18016369363893169877-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-1475814299079052968-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-17356878228807786695-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-2774113032651042041-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-12575564917278009569-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-111-text-7245982328111581423-effect","divergent-universe